  "implementation": [
    "Every DP1/CP1 PP-major/TP-minor rank enters a synchronized run_batch, including idle turns. Logical request/step identity is agreed before model execution.",
    "Compare cached projected-prefix state and draft weight digests. Clear stale or divergent request context on all ranks so source-KV collectives traverse the same ranges. Decode prefix projection completes before local proposal preparation.",
    "The last PP stage's TP0 supplies canonical proposal tokens and performs acceptance with matching corrected logits. Nonowners discard corrected logits from their local proposals.",
    "Worker set_decode_proposal rebuilds static verify IDs and grammar trees before forward and rejects duplicate, launched, adaptive or folded replacements.",
    "Execute target stages sequentially and relay step-bound activation frames before any accepted-context commit.",
    "Validate accepted lengths, vocabulary, prefix arithmetic, bonus and every accepted draft token on all ranks before local commit.",
    "Return local capture tickets and common next-draft state. Failed coordinators require worker restart.",
    "No public scheduler loop, PP speculative serving gate, Mooncake API or training snapshot schema changed."
  ],
